    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET YOUR NEW FRIEND: BUBS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 20+ minigames, follow Bubs the Cat as he leads you through a series of 5-second activities whether you like it or not</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in 48 hours for the Vancouver Global Game Jam 2025,  by a team of almost 20 people, made using the Godot Engine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by WarioWare and Four Second Frenzy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true 1-button game, BUBBLEWARE supports keyboard, mouse, controller and touchscreen. The only input is movement and one button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEYBOARD: WASD or Arrow Keys + Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOUSE: Mouse move + Left Click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTROLLER: Joystick + button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOBILE/TOUCHSCREEN: Drag and tap</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL CREDITS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncy<br>CapsuleCrush<br>Gibbtall<br>Rukat<br>Slivers<br>Vamtaro<br>Gogozi<br>Emma<br>Andrewnugooyeen<br>Meowmew<br>Rayflower<br>Suchipi<br>TinyGodzilla<br>Petrichor<br>Hellawack<br>Havlark</p>",
